WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:05.905
After having written her
a goodbye note, Mr. Albert left Candy.

00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:13.880
And Stear died at war.
Candy is very sad.

00:00:14.049 --> 00:00:18.756
Patty went back to Florida
so she could find peace.

00:00:19.001 --> 00:00:25.993
Candy hopes that everyone will find
happiness, despite the sad events.

00:00:28.631 --> 00:00:32.829
The day to meet the Uncle

00:00:35.571 --> 00:00:39.600
Mr. Albert didn't came
to Stear's funeral.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:45.705
But, he wouldn't know anything,
since it was not in the newspapers.

00:00:46.048 --> 00:00:48.075
Great Aunt Elroy attended the funeral.

00:00:48.225 --> 00:00:53.481
Stear died in a foreign country,
after leaving against her will,

00:00:53.631 --> 00:00:58.584
and she took it very hard.

00:00:59.929 --> 00:01:05.060
Mr. Albert...
The optimistic Stear is dead.

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:13.073
Why aren't you here,
to comfort me like you used to?

00:01:16.078 --> 00:01:19.570
Mr. Albert, where are you?

00:01:25.654 --> 00:01:30.421
This house is so empty,
there is only me.

00:01:34.597 --> 00:01:39.557
Candy, I made something good for you.

00:01:42.871 --> 00:01:52.542
The war in Europe is very cruel,
I am worried about Stear.

00:01:53.816 --> 00:01:56.979
The newspaper, that's right,
there it is!

00:02:03.192 --> 00:02:06.035
Yes, the ads!

00:02:06.185 --> 00:02:10.757
What if I put an ad in the newspapers,
maybe he will read it and come back.

00:02:11.066 --> 00:02:15.963
And maybe Terry will read it too!

00:02:16.113 --> 00:02:21.135
What should I write?
"Please come back, Mr. Albert?"

00:02:21.285 --> 00:02:25.670
No, not convincing enough.

00:02:27.549 --> 00:02:30.484
What about: "I am ill" ?

00:02:38.794 --> 00:02:39.753
What's this?

00:02:39.903 --> 00:02:43.696
Mr. William's true colours
will be revealed soon?

00:02:43.999 --> 00:02:50.331
No one ever saw him,
he was a mystery man until now.

00:02:50.481 --> 00:02:55.636
This is about to change, since
he decided to step out of the shadows.

00:02:55.786 --> 00:03:01.149
Who is this man,
everyone is wondering.

00:03:03.585 --> 00:03:09.083
Grandfather William, I was adopted
by him, but I never saw him.

00:03:09.233 --> 00:03:13.754
Who's he?

00:03:14.697 --> 00:03:16.021
Come in.

00:03:19.201 --> 00:03:21.626
Mr. Albert!

00:03:23.505 --> 00:03:25.370
Neil!

00:03:27.676 --> 00:03:31.238
Who's Albert?
The hobo who lost his memory?

00:03:31.388 --> 00:03:34.908
He's not a hobo!

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:38.114
He left you, didn't he?

00:03:38.754 --> 00:03:41.649
I know everything about you,
now that I did my investigation.

00:03:41.799 --> 00:03:45.520
And why would you do that?

00:03:46.428 --> 00:03:48.856
For a lot of reasons.

00:03:49.006 --> 00:03:52.799
Why? This is my private life!

00:03:53.936 --> 00:03:56.697
I did it
because I am going to marry you.

00:03:56.847 --> 00:04:02.469
To marry me?

00:04:02.619 --> 00:04:06.974
I came here to let you know.

00:04:07.124 --> 00:04:12.385
To let me know?
So you think I will accept to marry you?

00:04:13.088 --> 00:04:14.748
Of course!

00:04:14.898 --> 00:04:21.251
Why do you want to marry me?
You always treated me so bad.

00:04:23.132 --> 00:04:24.997
Because I love you.

00:04:26.401 --> 00:04:29.603
But I don't love you.

00:04:29.853 --> 00:04:34.102
You will love me some day.

00:04:34.643 --> 00:04:41.845
Neil, do you remember
the first time we met?

00:04:57.266 --> 00:05:01.464
From then on, you always teased me
and never stopped.

00:05:02.771 --> 00:05:09.142
If you had treated me well,
now it could be different.

00:05:10.779 --> 00:05:12.212
Neil.

00:05:13.682 --> 00:05:16.173
Do you want to throw that at me?

00:05:19.354 --> 00:05:24.867
Spilled water can never be put back.

00:05:25.017 --> 00:05:27.254
Leave!

00:05:27.404 --> 00:05:35.031
I will leave, but I will not give up!

00:05:39.741 --> 00:05:46.579
Why do all the people I love
are all gone?

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:54.050
Anthony, Terry, Stear,
and Mr. Albert.

00:05:56.124 --> 00:06:00.493
Why, why?

00:06:05.334 --> 00:06:07.461
Leave me alone!

00:06:09.338 --> 00:06:12.205
What's wrong, Candy?

00:06:13.175 --> 00:06:14.701
Doctor Martin!

00:06:14.851 --> 00:06:20.507
You didn't come to the clinic,
I was a bit worried.

00:06:20.657 --> 00:06:21.872
Sorry.

00:06:22.784 --> 00:06:27.050
I am sorry to see you crying.

00:06:27.422 --> 00:06:37.457
I understand how you feel. Life is cruel,
sometimes with pain and tears.

00:06:38.166 --> 00:06:46.039
Come on, Candy,
your patients need your smile.

00:06:47.342 --> 00:06:49.403
Everybody joined you!

00:06:49.553 --> 00:06:51.972
We came to bring you back, Candy,

00:06:52.122 --> 00:06:55.312
We need you back
at the Happy Clinic!

00:06:55.851 --> 00:07:00.845
Okay. Let's go there, and be happy!

00:07:05.894 --> 00:07:10.627
Neil, you're the heir of the Leagans.

00:07:10.999 --> 00:07:15.026
I will never allow you
to marry that girl!

00:07:15.737 --> 00:07:20.106
But she's the adopted daughter
of the Adleys.

00:07:20.842 --> 00:07:24.671
Their position is higher than ours.

00:07:24.821 --> 00:07:26.577
Neil!

00:07:27.816 --> 00:07:32.583
Mother, you should agree with brother.

00:07:33.255 --> 00:07:34.915
Eliza!

00:07:35.065 --> 00:07:37.484
Now, you're talking nonsense!

00:07:37.634 --> 00:07:41.017
Understand my position, mother.
I am against it too.

00:07:41.196 --> 00:07:47.461
But considering the situation,
I have to say he's right.

00:07:47.611 --> 00:07:51.999
Eliza, thank you so much.
I am so happy you are on my side!

00:07:52.149 --> 00:07:57.771
Brother, leave me alone with mother,
I would like to talk with her.

00:07:57.921 --> 00:08:00.178
Please, go ahead, Eliza.

00:08:05.988 --> 00:08:07.514
Mother.

00:08:07.664 --> 00:08:13.255
Eliza, I completely disagree
with this nonsense!

00:08:16.264 --> 00:08:22.229
Mother, think about it.
If brother marries Candy,

00:08:22.379 --> 00:08:25.569
her fortune will become his.

00:08:25.774 --> 00:08:29.536
What do you mean?

00:08:29.686 --> 00:08:34.674
Brother will be the inheritor
of the Adley family.

00:08:34.824 --> 00:08:40.953
Grandfather William is not young,
he can't last very long.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:47.705
You are right. But I will not
accept in the family a girl like her!

00:08:47.905 --> 00:08:53.994
After brother becomes heir of their
family, he just has to break up with her.

00:08:55.804 --> 00:09:01.367
Mother, the papers say that Grandfather
William will appear in public.

00:09:01.576 --> 00:09:04.838
So, let brother and Candy get married,
the timing is perfect.

00:09:04.988 --> 00:09:08.713
I will discuss it
with Great Aunt Elroy first.

00:09:13.021 --> 00:09:20.387
What is this stupid idea, while
this family is still morning Stear!

00:09:20.537 --> 00:09:29.429
Great Aunt, I know you mourn, but
think of the benefits for this family.

00:09:29.638 --> 00:09:32.065
What do you mean?

00:09:32.215 --> 00:09:37.337
If Candice marries someone unknown,

00:09:37.487 --> 00:09:41.641
everything she owns will be his.

00:09:41.791 --> 00:09:49.555
And the blood of the family
will be stained...

00:09:49.991 --> 00:09:51.518
Shut up!

00:09:51.668 --> 00:10:00.262
It makes sense to have Neil marry Candy.

00:10:00.869 --> 00:10:06.500
He said if he can't marry Candice,
he will go to Europe to join the army.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.370
No, I will not allow him to enrol!

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:15.609
I can't allow another grandson to die!

00:10:15.759 --> 00:10:22.514
So, in order to protect him,
please consider this discussion.

00:10:37.806 --> 00:10:39.267
OK.

00:10:40.609 --> 00:10:43.043
The rain stopped.

00:10:43.278 --> 00:10:45.143
Candy!

00:10:45.614 --> 00:10:47.912
Look, the rainbow!

00:10:48.283 --> 00:10:50.342
Where?

00:10:50.586 --> 00:10:55.689
It's really beautiful!
This is a good omen.

00:10:58.327 --> 00:11:00.454
It's a big carriage!

00:11:00.604 --> 00:11:02.463
Yes.

00:11:11.273 --> 00:11:14.735
Are you Miss Candice White Adley?

00:11:14.885 --> 00:11:15.536
Yes.

00:11:15.686 --> 00:11:20.908
Adley? Candy, you're from
the Adley family?

00:11:21.058 --> 00:11:22.476
She's their adopted daughter.

00:11:22.626 --> 00:11:25.111
Sorry, I didn't tell you.

00:11:26.955 --> 00:11:29.920
Lord William would like to see you.

00:11:30.092 --> 00:11:32.786
Did you say Lord William?

00:11:32.936 --> 00:11:36.888
Yes, and we brought you some clothes.
Do you want to wear them?

00:11:41.837 --> 00:11:43.327
Come in, please.

00:11:47.376 --> 00:11:53.406
I would have never imagined Candy
was adopted by the Adleys!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:58.045
This carriage is wonderful,
made for a princess.

00:11:58.195 --> 00:12:04.081
That's right. Candy is the adopted
daughter of a very rich family.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:09.621
- Candy!
- You're really beautiful!

00:12:11.333 --> 00:12:18.865
Doctor Martin, Grandfather William wants
to see me, it's going to be the first time.

00:12:19.308 --> 00:12:23.937
There are so many things
I want to tell him!

00:12:24.087 --> 00:12:26.173
Go, Candy.

00:12:26.323 --> 00:12:28.216
Thank you, Doctor Martin.

00:12:30.719 --> 00:12:32.516
Good bye.

00:12:38.093 --> 00:12:40.493
See you.

00:12:50.539 --> 00:12:53.333
I will finally meet Grandfather.

00:12:53.483 --> 00:13:02.120
I will thank him, and renounce to be
the adopted daughter of the Adleys.

00:13:17.566 --> 00:13:19.927
Candy, you came at last!

00:13:20.177 --> 00:13:21.967
Neil!

00:13:25.207 --> 00:13:26.902
Come.

00:13:39.554 --> 00:13:43.500
Brother, you are speechless.

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:45.034
Eliza!

00:13:45.184 --> 00:13:48.755
Candy, Great Aunt Elroy
is waiting for you.

00:13:48.905 --> 00:13:52.590
The Great Aunt? But, I am here
to see Grandfather William!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.703
You have to see
Great Aunt Elroy first.

00:14:03.211 --> 00:14:06.673
Miss Candice, congratulations!

00:14:06.823 --> 00:14:08.545
Congratulations!

00:14:08.884 --> 00:14:11.178
What for?

00:14:11.328 --> 00:14:16.150
Candice, Great Aunt is waiting for you.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:18.186
Mrs. Leagan!

00:14:19.494 --> 00:14:22.486
Go in, hurry!

00:14:25.534 --> 00:14:28.929
Great Aunt, what do you want from me?

00:14:29.079 --> 00:14:33.698
Candice, it was decided
that you will marry Neil.

00:14:33.848 --> 00:14:35.135
It was decided?

00:14:35.285 --> 00:14:39.740
We will make an official announcement
of the engagement soon.

00:14:39.898 --> 00:14:41.825
Great Aunt!

00:14:41.975 --> 00:14:47.164
Candice, even if you are Neil's fiancee,
please don't lose your politeness.

00:14:47.314 --> 00:14:53.137
Wait, I never said
I wanted to marry Neil!

00:14:53.287 --> 00:14:55.506
It is not for you to decide
if you will marry him or not.

00:14:55.656 --> 00:14:57.040
I beg our pardon?

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:01.484
Candy, this is the order
of Grandfather William.

00:15:02.221 --> 00:15:04.746
Grandfather William?

00:15:05.624 --> 00:15:07.153
Great Aunt...

00:15:10.662 --> 00:15:11.488
That...

00:15:11.638 --> 00:15:20.995
Candy, he took care of you since
you are a child. You can't disobey him.

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:26.370
We all disagreed with him,

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:31.712
but no one can oppose Grandfather.

00:15:39.091 --> 00:15:43.919
That's so cruel, so inhuman!

00:15:44.069 --> 00:15:49.557
Not even him
can he force me to marry someone!

00:15:52.004 --> 00:15:57.636
Mr. Albert, what should I do,
Mr. Albert?

00:16:00.846 --> 00:16:06.610
We brought the clothes
for your engagement.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:12.349
Where's Grandfather William?

00:16:12.599 --> 00:16:15.953
Well... he's not here.

00:16:16.103 --> 00:16:17.287
Then, where is he?

00:16:17.437 --> 00:16:19.389
We have no idea.

00:16:19.539 --> 00:16:28.202
He doesn't have the right to do this!
He can't force me to do this!

00:16:33.045 --> 00:16:39.943
I remember... I read Grandfather William
will make his appearance at the bank.

00:16:40.093 --> 00:16:44.215
Then, I will see him there.

00:16:47.326 --> 00:16:49.886
Miss Candice!

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.390
Please don't tell anyone I'm leaving.

00:16:59.638 --> 00:17:01.868
Thank you!

00:17:17.889 --> 00:17:20.150
You want to see Lord William?

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:22.557
Yes, I know he's here.

00:17:22.761 --> 00:17:25.487
Wait, miss!

00:17:29.501 --> 00:17:35.001
Grandfather, grandfather, there you are!
We need to talk!

00:17:36.675 --> 00:17:38.368
George?

00:17:38.518 --> 00:17:41.742
Miss Candice!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.841
Where's Grandfather?

00:17:44.991 --> 00:17:47.077
Why are you so excited?

00:17:47.327 --> 00:17:53.150
How can I be calm?
I am forced to marry Neil!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.353
What? Neil Leagan?

00:17:56.603 --> 00:17:58.155
You didn't know?

00:17:58.305 --> 00:18:01.507
Apparently it's Grandfather's wish.

00:18:03.134 --> 00:18:07.972
I have to tell him I am not his toy!

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:11.371
Miss Candy,
I will prepare a car for you.

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.370
A car?

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:16.740
Lord William is at Lakewood.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.982
Ah, he's at Lakewood?

00:18:36.701 --> 00:18:39.997
Nothing changed at all.

00:18:40.147 --> 00:18:42.438
I missed this place so much.

00:18:46.344 --> 00:18:50.405
This is the road to the Leagans'.

00:19:00.058 --> 00:19:02.988
Stear's stone door.

00:19:06.965 --> 00:19:09.195
Archie's water gate.

00:19:09.367 --> 00:19:12.359
Anthony's rose arch.

00:19:13.672 --> 00:19:15.469
Nothing changed.

00:19:15.807 --> 00:19:23.878
The time passed, but the roses are
as beautiful as they were then.

00:19:36.962 --> 00:19:41.524
This is for you, Sweet Candy.

00:19:42.801 --> 00:19:46.100
And the famous house.

00:20:12.964 --> 00:20:14.664
Miss Candice.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:19.830
Lord William wants to see you.
This way, please.

00:20:22.991 --> 00:20:28.146
No, I am too nervous!

00:20:32.017 --> 00:20:34.110
Please go in.

00:20:34.886 --> 00:20:37.514
Candy's heart is beating heavily.

00:20:42.027 --> 00:20:44.723
Here is Grandfather William.

00:20:49.834 --> 00:20:56.099
During the trip, she had thought
about what to tell him.

00:20:56.249 --> 00:20:58.472
But now that he's right there,
she can't find the words.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:02.544
Her legs are shaking,
she can barely stand up.

00:21:03.848 --> 00:21:11.751
Grandfather William's chair
turns slowly this way.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:19.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by Rémi
